        <register>
          <name>NRX_FREQUENCY_CONTROL</name>
          <description>NRX initialization and frequency quotient word. Complete phy_nrx_freq_set samples and preserves the high byte and writes a twenty-four-bit quotient. Initialization writes the same complete low twenty-four-bit region with its own image.</description>
