          <description>Complete hal_he_set_ersu_ack_rate writes the same byte through four separate fresh-read RMWs: argument zero selects 0x80 and nonzero selects 0xa0. Complete trc_set_bf_report_rate calls this leaf after publishing BF_REPORT_RATE, selecting 0xa0 only for its low-link-metric DCM plus ER-SU branch.</description>
