        <register>
          <name>ERSU_AND_VHT_CONTROL</name>
          <description>Complete dbg_read_bsr_info names bits 8:2 and the comparison method. Complete dbg_read_rx_misc names bits 9:11. Complete dbg_tb_ignore_cca_enable proves that bit 12 set means TB respects CCA and NAV, while clearing it enables the debug ignore mode. Complete hal_he_bsr_init initializes the BSR comparison method and control bits. The HE Operation ER-SU-Disable bit at complete-IE byte five bit zero controls bit 10 through complete hal_he_set_ersu. VHT bandwidth-signaling RTS disable later clears bit 22.</description>
